Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you\Nshowed up for our rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't concern you, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to see darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,As we speak, the Great Leviathan lurks\Nin the shadows all over the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I defeat you, your life\Nenergy will be offered to the Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This madness has to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to remind you why\NI've already crushed you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember Gravity Axe, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to summon my Guardian Grawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move, and I activate the\Nmagic card Five Star Twilight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,To call forth the Five Karibo Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I play the Seal of Orichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fate is sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This time the seal belongs to me.\NWhat were you thinking, Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now one of us is going to lose his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the whole point, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Leviathan needs power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I take you down\Nand capture your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.09,0:02:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that legendary creature will have\Nthe strength it needs to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.35,0:02:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same guy who\Nbeat Yugi last time. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Obelisk has no equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have had a taste of its\Nboundless energy in our last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll show you what it can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're infused with the power\Nof the seal, Guardian Grawl, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his powder puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rope of life! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back the monster that you\Njust destroyed after I discard my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Curry Babylon, return to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only got a thousand life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you kidding, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's won duels with way fewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the duelist who\Nbeat the King of Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this is Yugi's chance to win back his\Nreputation and his championship status.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can take it away. My move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll transform my Curry Babylon\Nback into the five Kaiba brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to take on a new force
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the circus act?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Merge again, my Karibos. This\Ntime to form Curry Bandit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, Raphael, the last\Nthing I'd be doing is laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I just activated my\NDark Magic Curtain. This
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,card allows me to summon\Nmy ultimate monster
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.11,0:04:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd I tell ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But he just gave up half\Nof his life points What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of his plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, destroy Guardian Elma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Trap Card, Guardian Formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's safe. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal of Orykalkos gives\Nme an extra row of monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:05:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so my Trap Card moved\NElma to the back row. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she can't be destroyed without\Ngoing through my front line first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Try fighting instead of hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows how to tap into\Nall the seal's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to bring out\Nmy ultimate monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But first I'll play this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Sword of Iatos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sword of Iathos?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to summon Guardian Iathos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll draw two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to play the\Ncard that beat you last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my Guardian Iathos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to act quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With 500 points left,\NI don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done to your guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been consumed by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, and it's more\Npowerful than ever now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When Curry Bandit is sacrificed,\NI can draw five more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I'm only allowed to\Nkeep the magic and trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My monsters go straight to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll just make Iatos more powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, but it could have been worth\Nthe risk if Yugi drew the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll find out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept two and discarded three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the strength of the three monsters\Nyou discarded is added to my guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Iatos, raise your sword and\Ndrain his monster's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,7,000? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to become a two-time loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and this time you're gonna\Npay up with your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Iato's, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to clear things up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A few moments ago, I sent three monsters\Nto my graveyard, one of which saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That card was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My electromagnetic turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.91,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When this monster was destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it created an electromagnetic barrier,\Nshielding my magician from your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He had that planned all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In your face, meathead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the pharaoh's gonna pay\Nfor mocking the power of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,my guardian iatos i end\Nmy turn perhaps you should
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,have thought twice before\Nyou poisoned your own
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters with the dark\Npowers of the orichalcos take
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it from someone with\Nexperience betraying your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters only backfires\Nin the end you played the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,seal of orichalcos once\Nand all of a sudden you're
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An expert on the subject.\NJust go as you wish now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon big shield\Ngardener in defense move
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll switch my Dark\NMagician into defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.19,0:09:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win a duel with defense Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,all you're doing is\Nstalling for time Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your time's just run out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Iatos destroy his most valuable\Nmonster, the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparrow, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical Hatch, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide my monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical Hatch shuffled Yugi's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So Blondie blasted the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, but he gets to attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yugi's magician's still in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these three remaining\Nhats is concealing my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.37,0:09:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me with your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hats and one monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use Elma to improve my odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll send in Grawl\Nto finish things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Elma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Find this dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have a 50-50 shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Grawl, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you used up\Nall of your chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have messed that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to win the duel\Nand capture the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn's not over just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my Rod of Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me play\Nanother Guardian monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My all-powerful Guardian KS!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing\Nthat can save him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see if he has what it\Ntakes to play it let's move
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.19,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,on first I activate the magic\Ncard graceful charity this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,allows me to draw three new\Ncards as long as I discard two
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,this is my final chance please\Npart of the cards guide me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me. I'm afraid it's\Ntrue. I've drawn the eye of Timaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Timaeus, arise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:11:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I merge my dragon\Nwith my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Combine to form...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Amulet Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My new dragon gets 300 points for each\Nmagic card in my graveyard! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And in case you haven't been counting...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means my amulet dragon\Ngets an extra 2400 attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Amulet dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his guardian, Iatos!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Iatos!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be sorry, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody sends my guardian\NIatos to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's the seal doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a glitch in the hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My guardian Iatos is a\Ncreature of light and purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it's destroyed, it's\Nreplaced by a different creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A creature of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one word: nasty! Here's four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, when Iatos\Ngoes to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,this monster is summoned\Nto the field in its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So say hello to my Guardian Dread Scythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, and goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no match for my dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll boost its strength\Nwith my Reaper Scythe Magic Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, for the best part,\Nthanks to its new weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my Guardian of Darkness gains 500 attack\Npoints for every monster in my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you despised having\Nmonsters in your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I despise you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's a few monsters in the grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means destroying you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And with only 500 life points\Nleft, you won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound pretty anxious\Nto lose your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.41,0:15:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll start by switching Guardian\NDread Scythe into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll sacrifice every other monster I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,have so Dread Scythe can\Nabsorb their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ori Kalkos is clouding your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, don't you understand\Nwhat you've just done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I know\Nexactly what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've added 2,000 attack points\Nto my Guardian Dreadsign.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it in weak, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Raphael's monster is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Guardian Dreadsign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Rid the field of his dragon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no monsters left\Nto protect your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.41,0:16:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's pretty confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he win without that dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I activate card of sanctity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we both draw from our decks\Nuntil we're holding six cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I summon Waterpawn to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll sacrifice Waterpawn in order to\Nplay my Dark Magician Girl into Vengeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play this and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time I\Nput you out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's end this, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.11,0:17:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have the perfect card to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Obedience!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now when my guardian attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can force your dark magician\Ngirl to switch into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So when she goes, so do the\Nrest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dread Scythe, let the fun begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out his magician and his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Magical Pigeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you confused? This magic card\Ncan only be used on Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,it protects her from an attack by\Ntransforming her into a pigeon for one turn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just stalling i place two\Ncards face down and end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vero, can't you see that\Nyou're out of options?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to drag this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware that the odds are in your\Nfavor, but that's no reason to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, you may have the magic of the\NOri Kalkos, but I have something stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.53,0:18:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A belief in the heart of\Nthe cards, and in myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How soon we forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You were once ruled by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I was able to conquer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.95,0:18:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you started taking some\Nresponsibility for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be a man for once\Nand face me in a duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the trap card, Divine Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You passed the test, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,By defeating me, you were able to defeat\Nthe darkness that was inside your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I must help Raphael conquer\Nthe darkness in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is far from over, Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can do for him what Yugi did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know firsthand what the Orycalcos does\Nto a person's heart, and I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When Iatos was destroyed, you unleashed\Nyour anger on your other monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.39,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You let the Orycalcos feed\Non your rage, like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That this isn't who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness within you has taken control,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you must face\Nthat darkness head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way for\Nyou to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe my words,\Nthen maybe this will convince you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.43,0:20:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A card that forces you to take\Na closer look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.73,0:20:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Underworld Circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth does that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take some responsibility\Nfor what you've done, Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Underworld Circle, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and so is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, witness your true darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the looks of that. Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even see what's going on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.99,0:20:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope when the smoke clears,\Nit's the pharaoh that's standing.
